{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-voice-scribe#caveat-1","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-voice-scribe","commit":"e1d2e74b54613191b39bb6242b9d084a2f27b540","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-scribe 使用云端 ASR 时会把录音发送到所配置的 OpenAI 兼容识别端点；默认端点是 api.groq.com。此方式需要用户配置 API key，本地 SenseVoice 路径则在本机识别。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host-utils.js:19","lib/host-utils.js:668-704","lib/local-asr.js:3-12"]}
{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-voice-scribe#caveat-2","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-voice-scribe","commit":"e1d2e74b54613191b39bb6242b9d084a2f27b540","type":"caveat","lang":"en","text":"Cloud ASR sends recordings to the configured endpoint and needs an API key; local SenseVoice runs on the host.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host-utils.js:19","lib/host-utils.js:668-704","lib/local-asr.js:3-12"]}
